				<element type="warning_sequence">2</element>
                <text type="warning_situation">
				<p>MINOR FLOODING OCCURRING AT WANSTEAD RD AND POSSIBLE AT LANGHORNE CREEK (UPSTREAM)</p>

				<p/>
				<p>Heavy rainfall has caused river level rises and areas of flooding across the Bremer River catchment. Minor flooding is currently occurring along the Bremer River at Wanstead Rd. Downstream, the main peak is currently approaching Langhorne Creek (Upstream) where minor flooding is possible Monday afternoon. </p>

				<p/>

                </text>
                <element type="severity">Minor</element>
